That's all I can really think of to say about it.  The game was
reasonably tricky; having to go so far without a bag of holding is no
fun, if nothing else.

Ironically, this is my first good game where I've ever been able to
wear an amulet of life saving, and I didn't even need it. Normally, for
one reason or another, I'm stuck wearing an amulet of reflection.  Is
this normal, or should I be trying to switch back and forth between
